-name: migration-scratch-verification-recipe
-description: EF migration and field-removal facts (DropCheckConstraint, lossy Down, unknown JSON members, one contract commit); the scratch-Postgres Up/Down/Up and scratch API steps are impl-test / tester only
-metadata:
